  "real-time-execution-action-chunking-flow-policies": [
    "<div data-page-id=\"ZAdTdYji5onnRKxS7eecsa5sn7g\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\"><div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZUN7dVThxo4cXcxqEzecbybVnSb\">具体如何衔接：Inpainting ，一部分内容已经确定，把缺失的部分在“与已知部分保持一致”的条件下生成出来。</div><div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZUN7dVThxo4cXcxqEzecbybVnSb\"><img src=\"/images/papers/rtc-soft-masking-timeline.png\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECQEd6e1yoqtePx392icArTmnQd\"><strong>软间隔区：</strong>因为推理延迟，已经被执行的旧的chunk已经无法改变，改变的是旧的chunk与新的chunk重叠且还未被执行的动作。新的chunk在生成这些动作的时候，会以旧 chunk 对应动作作为参考，越靠近当前时刻，权重越大，新动作越倾向于贴近旧 chunk；越往未来，权重越小，新动作越可以根据最新 observation 改变。论文把整个 H−s 的重叠区域都利用起来：前 d 步权重为 1，中间区域逐渐衰减，最后 s 步权重为 0。</div><div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U5HPdct26oD705xaTPzc0g3VnPe\"><img src=\"/images/papers/rtc-soft-masking-equation.png\" alt=\"\"><br></div></div><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;isCut&quot;:false,&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;ZAdTdYji5onnRKxS7eecsa5sn7g&quot;,&quot;parentId&quot;:&quot;ZAdTdYji5onnRKxS7eecsa5sn7g&quot;,&quot;blockIds&quot;:[23,24,25,26,27],&quot;recordIds&quot;:[&quot;ZUN7dVThxo4cXcxqEzecbybVnSb&quot;,&quot;Y2RSdvPJJoT6sdxBTrUc9WOHnEe&quot;,&quot;ECQEd6e1yoqtePx392icArTmnQd&quot;,&quot;U5HPdct26oD705xaTPzc0g3VnPe&quot;,&quot;UlgVdb54FoBa49xM4UEcHTNkn0f&quot;],&quot;recordMap&quot;:{&quot;ZUN7dVThxo4cXcxqEzecbybVnSb&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ZUN7dVThxo4cXcxqEzecbybVnSb&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;revisions&quot;:[],&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7667422066571774935&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;ZAdTdYji5onnRKxS7eecsa5sn7g&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:[],&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+1k&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;具体如何衔接：Inpainting ，一部分内容已经确定，把缺失的部分在“与已知部分保持一致”的条件下生成出来。&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;nextNum&quot;:1,&quot;numToAttrib&quot